! -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-----------------|
-[N][Abs][SgUnpd]:%<&                  EncliticOrEnd; -[N][Abs][PlUnpd]:%<%%%:(e)t&            EncliticOrEnd; -[N][Abs][DuUnpd]:%<%%%:(e)k&              EncliticOrEnd; ! unpossessed   |
