-[N][Abs][3SgPoss][SgPosd]:%<%:(ng)a↞&     EncliticOrEnd; -[N][Abs][3SgPoss][PlPosd]:%<%:(ng)i↞&       EncliticOrEnd; -[N][Abs][3SgPoss][DuPosd]:%<%%%:(e)k↞&        EncliticOrEnd; ! 3SG possessor |
