-[N][Abs][1PlPoss][SgPosd]:%<↞+p|.vut&     EncliticOrEnd;
-[N][Abs][1DuPoss][SgPosd]:%<↞–puk&        EncliticOrEnd; -[N][Abs][1DuPoss][PlPosd]:%<↞–puk&          EncliticOrEnd; -[N][Abs][1DuPoss][DuPosd]:%<%%%:(e)g↞puk&     EncliticOrEnd; ! 1Du possessor |
