!!!      Person-Number Inflection (Dependent Mood Markers)       !!!
!!!                                                              !!!
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!


LEXICON IntransitiveSubordinative
!-------------------------|----------------------------|---------------------------|
[S_4Sg]:ni   EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Sg]:%:nga EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Sg]:[STE_2Sg]  EncliticOrEnd;
!                                                         [S_2Sg]:k    EncliticOrEnd; ! for special te with na
[S_4Pl]:teng EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Pl]:ta    EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Pl]:ci   EncliticOrEnd;
[S_4Du]:tek  EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Du]:nuk   EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Du]:tek  EncliticOrEnd;
                            [S_1Du]:nung  EncliticOrEnd;
!-------------------------|----------------------------|---------------------------|

LEXICON TransitiveSubordinative
!--------------------------|-------------------------|---------------------------|
[P_3Sg]:ku    EncliticOrEnd; [P_3Pl]:ki EncliticOrEnd; [P_3Du]:kek  EncliticOrEnd;
[P_1Sg]:%:nga EncliticOrEnd; [P_1Pl]:ta EncliticOrEnd; [P_1Du]:nuk  EncliticOrEnd;
                                                       [P_1Du]:nung EncliticOrEnd;
[P_2Sg]:ten   EncliticOrEnd; [P_2Pl]:ci EncliticOrEnd; [P_2Du]:tek  EncliticOrEnd;
!--------------------------|-------------------------|---------------------------|


LEXICON IntransitiveConnective
!-----------------------------|------------------------------|--------------------------------|----------------------------|
[S_3Sg]:%:an     EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Sg]:+ma     EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Sg]:+p|.vet   EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Sg]:+mi   EncliticOrEnd;
[S_3Pl]:%:ata    EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Pl]:–mta    EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Pl]:+p|.veci  EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Pl]:+meng EncliticOrEnd;
[S_3Du]:%:agnek  EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Du]:–megnuk EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Du]:+p|.vtek  EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Du]:+mek  EncliticOrEnd;
!-----------------------------|------------------------------|--------------------------------|----------------------------|

LEXICON IntransitiveConnectiveCond
!-----------------------------|------------------------------|-----------------------------|----------------------------|
[S_3Sg]:%:an     EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Sg]:+ma     EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Sg]:.vet   EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Sg]:+ni   EncliticOrEnd;
[S_3Pl]:%:ata    EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Pl]:–mta    EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Pl]:.veci  EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Pl]:+neng EncliticOrEnd;
[S_3Du]:%:agnek  EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Du]:–megnuk EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Du]:.vtek  EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Du]:+nek  EncliticOrEnd;
!-----------------------------|------------------------------|-----------------------------|----------------------------|

LEXICON IntransitiveConnectiveCtmp
!----------------------------|------------------------------|-------------------------------|------------------------------|
[S_3Sg]:%:ani   EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Sg]:–mni    EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Sg]:+peni    EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Sg]:+mini   EncliticOrEnd;
[S_3Pl]:%:atni  EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Pl]:–mten̄i  EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Pl]:+pecen̄i  EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Pl]:+meggni EncliticOrEnd;
[S_3Du]:%:agni  EncliticOrEnd; [S_1Du]:–megni  EncliticOrEnd; [S_2Du]:+petegni EncliticOrEnd; [S_4Du]:+megni  EncliticOrEnd;
!----------------------------|------------------------------|-------------------------------|------------------------------|


LEXICON TransitiveConnective
