LEXICON DimensionalPostbase
-+tu[N→V]:%<+tu          VerbPostbase; ! to be well endowed with N, to have N to a large extent
-+kite2[N→V]:%<+kite°    VerbPostbase; ! to have N to a small degree; to have only a small amount of N 

LEXICON EmotionalPostbase
-–ke4[V→V]:%<–k̲e               VerbPostbase; ! to feel V toward (him/it); to V (object)
-@~+narqe[V→V]:%<@¹~+narqe     VerbPostbase; ! to tend to cause one to V; to be able to be V-ed
-@~+naite[V→V]:%<@¹~+naite     VerbPostbase; ! to tend not to cause one to V
-+tar1[V→V]:%<+tar             VerbPostbase; ! to tend by oneʼs disposition or nature to V a lot
-+taite2[V→V]:%<+taite°        VerbPostbase; ! to tend by oneʼs disposition or nature not to V
-@~+yug[V→V]:%<@ʸ~+yug         VerbPostbase; ! to want to V; to tend to V; to feel V (with “emotional roots”)


LEXICON PosturalPostbase
QuantQualInflection;
-+te2[V→V]:%<+te            VerbPostbase; ! to act on one so as to cause it to V
-@–ngqa[V→V]:%<@⁵–ngqa      VerbPostbase; ! to be in a state of V or of having V-ed or having been V-ed
-@–ngqa[V→V]:%<@⁵–ngqar     QuantQualInflection; ! to be in a state of V or of having V-ed or having been V-ed


LEXICON QuantQualPostbase
QuantQualInflection;
-–rrar*[N→N]:%<–r̲r̲ar*      QuantQualPostbase; ! just a little N; a little bit of N; a few N; and -rrar-to V a little; to just barely V


